Date: Tue, 15 May 2018 11:58:02 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] policy: Add support for device alert sliders.

* Provide support for alert slider hardware.
  Ability to swap order of alert slider within system setting.
  Enable setting config_hasAlertSlider to true and defining
  proc nodes for state path and UEvent match path.

 * Contributors:
 @ Sirhc95
 @ ZVNexus
 @ carlosavignano
 @ thecrazyskull

Adapted to MikuUI's miku_config.xml and miku_symbols.xml and the
current Android 17 PhoneWindowManager/AudioService.

Change-Id: I762a3e6f5f31b50cd96130a71ad263d5b9f1161e
